er Prize, the National Book Award, the National Book Critics Circle Award, and the Rebekah Johnson Bobbitt National Prize for Poetry from the Library of Congress.\n\nNatasha Trethewey was born in Gulfport, Mississippi, on April 26, 1966. She"
