\"\n\n19. Eminem and Kim Mathers\n\nRapper Eminem (aka Marshall Mathers), wrote many songs about his longtime love, Kim. But since they weren't exactly Coldplay ballads, it's no surprise that their relationship had its ups and down. The childhood sweethearts met at a house party when he"
